abstract: >-
  A DSH (DeepSeek Harness) sidebar plugin that adds long-press drag reordering and
  tuck-away-to-More for the global panel strip, implemented with read-only slot
  access and inline DOM ordering to avoid re-registration feedback loops.
keywords:
  - DSH plugin
  - DeepSeek Harness
